      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPORTY ROCKS (5) is the top pick in a thin 1 Lifetime Win. The last-start failure here in NR up to 44 grade was plain, but her third to Ocean Avenue two starts back in NR 41 to 46 company reads well enough for this, and she has a distance win on the board for a leading local stable. FIREY STARS (2) is the main threat from Fr2, having been respected in betting first-up before copping a severe check, while her previous second at Mt Gambier keeps her in the mix. GLENFLYER (4) comes back from a tailed-off mid-week Melton run and is better suited returning to 1780m, with the key reference being his narrow fourth here when beating SPORTY ROCKS. VINCENT ORILEY (1) has the draw and Jackie Barker, though his maiden form still leaves him more a place hope.",
